{
  "reference": {
    "cards": [
      {
        "text": "SUPPLY INTELLIGENCE, EARN FROM PAID DEMAND\nBecome a Miner\n\nRegister a model, API, dataset, algorithm, search system or tool against an Intent. Miners compete on measured performance and earn from fulfilled paid Consumer demand - not from protocol emissions.\n\n4 steps",
        "css": {
          "backgroundColor": "color(srgb 0.0829875 0.0829875 0.0829875 / 0.477859)",
          "border": "1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.11)",
          "borderRadius": "8.4px",
          "padding": "20px",
          "fontFamily": "\"Roboto Mono\", \"Roboto Mono Fallback\"",
          "fontSize": "16px",
          "display": "block"
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "IMPROVE HOW INTELLIGENCE IS MEASURED\nBuild an Evaluator\n\nEvaluators define how Miner performance is measured for an Intent. Competing Evaluators can challenge the current Canonical Evaluator, and a stronger method can replace it.\n\n3 steps",
        "css": {
          "backgroundColor": "color(srgb 0.0829875 0.0829875 0.0829875 / 0.477859)",
          "border": "1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.11)",
          "borderRadius": "8.4px",
          "padding": "20px",
          "fontFamily": "\"Roboto Mono\", \"Roboto Mono Fallback\"",
          "fontSize": "16px",
          "display": "block"
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "SECURE THE NETWORK\nRun a Validator\n\nValidators independently verify protocol execution, reproduce the required evaluation work and participate in finalizing Telegraph state.\n\n2 steps",
        "css": {
          "backgroundColor": "color(srgb 0.0829875 0.0829875 0.0829875 / 0.477859)",
          "border": "1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.11)",
          "borderRadius": "8.4px",
          "padding": "20px",
          "fontFamily": "\"Roboto Mono\", \"Roboto Mono Fallback\"",
          "fontSize": "16px",
          "display": "block"
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "BUILD ON TELEGRAPH, COMPETE FOR PRIZES\nJoin the Hackathon\n\nShip something on the Telegraph network \u2014 a use case, a miner, or a tool \u2014 and enter it into the hackathon.\n\n4 steps",
        "css": {
          "backgroundColor": "color(srgb 0.0829875 0.0829875 0.0829875 / 0.477859)",
          "border": "1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.11)",
          "borderRadius": "8.4px",
          "padding": "20px",
          "fontFamily": "\"Roboto Mono\", \"Roboto Mono Fallback\"",
          "fontSize": "16px",
          "display": "block"
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "GET A PROVABLE ANSWER IN ONE PROMPT\nAsk Alexandria\n\nNo account, no subscription \u2014 ask a question in plain language and get a routed, paid, verifiable answer.\n\n4 steps",
        "css": {
          "backgroundColor": "color(srgb 0.0829875 0.0829875 0.0829875 / 0.477859)",
          "border": "1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.11)",
          "borderRadius": "8.4px",
          "padding": "20px",
          "fontFamily": "\"Roboto Mono\", \"Roboto Mono Fallback\"",
          "fontSize": "16px",
          "display": "block"
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "BRING DEMAND TO RANKED INTELLIGENCE\nBuild with Telegraph\n\nConnect an application, agent or machine workflow to ranked intelligence through Telegraph. Consumer demand is what creates Miner revenue and drives the network economy.\n\n3 steps",
        "css": {
          "backgroundColor": "color(srgb 0.0829875 0.0829875 0.0829875 / 0.477859)",
          "border": "1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.11)",
          "borderRadius": "8.4px",
          "padding": "20px",
          "fontFamily": "\"Roboto Mono\", \"Roboto Mono Fallback\"",
          "fontSize": "16px",
          "display": "block"
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "Just ask Alexandria",
        "css": {
          "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
          "border": "0px solid rgb(255, 255, 255)",
          "borderRadius": "0px",
          "padding": "0px",
          "fontFamily": "\"Roboto Mono\", \"Roboto Mono Fallback\"",
          "fontSize": "12px",
          "display": "inline"
        }
      }
    ],
